<b>D{*\c&H716B6A&}e{*\c&H726C6B&}r{*\c&H746E6C&}a{*\c&H756F6D&}n{*\c&H76706E&}g{*\c&H77716F&}e{*\c&H787371&}d {*\c&H7B7573&}G{*\c&H7C7674&}e{*\c&H7D7775&}n{*\c&H7E7976&}e {*\c&H817B78&}E{*\c&H827C79&}x{*\c&H837E7A&}p{*\c&H847F7B&}e{*\c&H85807C&}r{*\c&H87817D&\fay-0.05}iments...</b>

00:37.031 --> 00:40.371
<b><i>none of his ideas or theories ever received</i></b>

00:41.041 --> 00:43.411
<b><i>{even the slightest }any support from the scientific community.</i></b>

00:45.791 --> 00:48.381
<b><i>"We should strive not to advance civilization,</i></b>

00:48.381 --> 00:51.801
<b><i>but to drive forward the evolution of the human species."</i></b>

00:51.801 --> 00:55.761
<b><i>That was his lifelong dream{the only dream he had ever had},{is this ok? tlc}</i></b>

00:55.761 --> 00:59.301
<b><i>but not a single person 
came forward to help him fulfill it.</i></b>

00:59.601 --> 01:01.311
<b>Damn these apes!</b>

01:01.931 --> 01:05.561
<b>"Dangerous ideas"? How dare they 
write about me as if I were some freak!{Writing about me as if I were some freak?}</b>

01:06.351 --> 01:11.321
<b>Do they really think humans have come this far by avoiding risks?</b>

01:11.321 --> 01:15.451
<b>Idiots who think they no longer need to evolve</b>

01:16.151 --> 01:19.241
<b>have no right to pass on their genes!</b>

01:19.241 --> 01:23.241
<b>Of course, this plan was always for my own sake.</b>

01:23.241 --> 01:26.041
<b>Even if I must do it alone, I <i>will</i> do it!{I will carry it out… even if I must do it all myself!}</b>

01:30.041 --> 01:33.091
<b><i>Thereafter, he devoted himself to his research.</i></b>

01:33.091 --> 01:37.631
<b><i>It was only after he turned 70 that his efforts began to yield results.</i></b>

01:45.391 --> 01:49.151
<b><i>First, the scientist regained his youth.</i></b>

01:49.151 --> 01:52.901
<b><i>Next, he began cloning himself.</i></b>

01:53.861 --> 01:57.741
<b><i>He named his laboratory the House of Evolution,</i></b>

01:57.741 --> 01:59.531
<b><i>and together with his clones,</i></b>

01:59.531 --> 02:04.741
<b><i>he conducted countless experiments with animals to create new species.</i></b>

02:04.741 --> 02:07.711
<b><i>Eventually, his experiments shifted to human subjects—</i></b>

02:07.711 --> 02:09.171
<b>This is taking too long!{timing: cps}</b>

02:09.171 --> 02:09.711
<b>Huh?</b>

02:10.291 --> 02:14.051
<b>What's this got to do with me? 
You're just trying to act cool again.</b>

02:15.761 --> 02:18.381
<b>Just get to the point, okay?</b>

02:18.881 --> 02:20.971
<b>My master is a busy man.</b>

02:20.971 --> 02:23.101
<b>Summarize it in 20 words or less.{lol is this a reference to twitter?}{i guess so but it's funny enough without, and "characters" doesn't work too well in latin speech}</b>

02:25.181 --> 02:27.351
<b>I-I'm sorry.</b>

