03:59.611 --> 04:02.071
<b>So, in other words,</b>

04:02.611 --> 04:06.321
<b>my boss has developed 
a keen interest in{become very curious about} your body.</b>

04:07.411 --> 04:09.871
<b>Too bad, I don't swing that way.{I'm not interested in dudes.}</b>

04:09.871 --> 04:11.581
<b>I think you misunderstood, Master.</b>

04:12.871 --> 04:15.831
<b>He plans to use your body, 
which surpasses human limitations,</b>

04:16.131 --> 04:19.301
<b>to further his research on evolution.</b>

04:20.301 --> 04:23.841
<b>If we don't do something, 
I'm sure he'll try attacking us again.</b>

04:24.471 --> 04:26.471
<b>We cannot let him do as he pleases{allow him a free hand}.</b>

04:27.091 --> 04:29.261
<b>Our next move should be a counterattack{to attack him}.</b>

04:30.771 --> 04:32.641
<b>Sure, let's go.</b>

04:33.101 --> 04:33.811
<b>Okay.</b>

04:36.311 --> 04:36.941
<b>Huh?</b>

04:37.231 --> 04:38.311
<b>Now?!</b>

04:38.311 --> 04:40.691
<b>Yeah, there's a sale{ on} tomorrow.</b>

04:40.691 --> 04:42.111
<b>Can't do it then.</b>

04:42.611 --> 04:43.991
<b>Master!</b>

04:43.991 --> 04:44.951
<b><i>This is bad{doesn't sound good}.</i></b>

04:44.951 --> 04:47.031
<b><i>Better tell the Doctor…</i></b>

04:47.991 --> 04:48.951
<b>Hey, you.</b>

04:48.951 --> 04:50.201
<b>Y-Yes?</b>

04:50.201 --> 04:52.161
<b>I have one final question{last inquiry}.</b>

04:52.161 --> 04:56.751
<b>Was the House of Evolution developing cyborgs prior to four years ago?</b>

04:57.331 --> 04:58.961
<b>How many more cyborgs are there?</b>

04:58.961 --> 05:01.711
<b>Have any of them destroyed towns in the past?</b>

05:01.711 --> 05:03.631
<b>I-I'm not sure,</b>

05:03.631 --> 05:07.181
<b>but at the House of Evolution, I'm the only combat cyborg.</b>

05:10.761 --> 05:11.761
<b>Impossible!</b>

05:12.221 --> 05:16.731
<b>Our elite force, bred to exterminate 
these obsolete humans, was wiped out?!{Our elite force, formed for the extermination of these obsolete humans, wiped out?!}{alt: Our elite human extermination force was wiped out?!}</b>

05:16.731 --> 05:21.651
<b>According to Armored Gorilla's report, 
the two responsible are on their way here.</b>

05:24.401 --> 05:26.571
<b>If they come,</b>

05:26.571 --> 05:31.031
<b>all our research, everything we've 
been working on, could be destroyed.</b>

05:31.331 --> 05:33.291
<b>This is a serious matter.</b>

05:34.251 --> 05:36.541
<b>The only option is to use our trump card.</b>

05:39.001 --> 05:42.131
<b>Begin preparations to release Carnage Kabuto.</b>

05:43.211 --> 05:43.801
<b>{nani}What?!</b>

05:43.801 --> 05:44.711
<b>{soitsu dake wa}No, not him!</b>

05:44.711 --> 05:45.631
<b>{sore wa muri da}That's crazy!</b>

05:45.631 --> 05:46.381
<b>{toutou hanatsu ka}He'll finally be released?</b>

05:46.381 --> 05:49.141
<b>{iya tashika ni sore shika houhou wa nai}He's right. That might be the only way.</b>

05:47.431 --> 05:49.141
<b>{iya, yameta hou ga yoi no de wa}It's still not a good idea.</b>

05:49.591 --> 05:51.891
<b>{sore demo kiken sugiru}It's too dangerous.</b>

05:51.891 --> 05:52.971
<b>{iya na yokan da}I have a bad feeling about this.</b>

05:52.971 --> 05:54.141
<b>{sore shika nai no ka}Is this our only option?</b>

05:53.641 --> 05:54.141
<b>Stay calm!</b>

05:54.971 --> 05:56.641
<b>He will be our last resort.</b>

05:57.521 --> 05:59.231
<b>But…</b>

05:59.231 --> 06:03.651
<b>First, we'll activate all the traps on 
the first floor through to the eighth.</b>

06:03.651 --> 06:05.691
<b>If we're lucky, they will take care of the intruders.</b>

06:07.071 --> 06:09.411
<b>I'm fully aware of what will happen to me</b>

06:10.361 --> 06:11.951
<b>should we fail.</b>

06:14.911 --> 06:17.791
<b>I didn't think we'd be running the whole way.</b>

06:17.791 --> 06:19.581
<b>How else would we{are we gonna} get there?</b>

06:19.581 --> 06:23.171
<b>I was sure you would be capable of flight.{I figured you could fly or something.}{"figured" is a bit too casual for genos, especially this early in the series before he learns to chill out a bit}</b>

06:23.171 --> 06:25.131
<b>Humans can't fly, you know.</b>

06:25.801 --> 06:27.881
<b>It's amazing that you are never late.</b>

06:28.301 --> 06:29.971
<b>You are a true hero.{As expected of a true hero.}</b>

06:29.971 --> 06:32.891
<b>Actually, I'm almost never{I hardly ever arrive} on time.</b>

06:35.721 --> 06:36.721
<b>We're here.</b>

06:37.431 --> 06:39.481
<b>This is the place Gorilla told us about.{the problem here was that "that Gorilla" gets grouped up mentally instead of being "that" being read like "which" as intended}</b>

06:40.561 --> 06:41.851
<b>So this is…</b>

06:41.851 --> 06:43.271
<b>…the House of Evolution.</b>

06:44.151 --> 06:46.981
<b>One, two, three, four, five, six…</b>

06:47.611 --> 06:49.781
<b>Looks like it's about eight stories high.</b>

07:01.121 --> 07:05.131
<b>Uh… what the hell was that?{WHAT WAS THAT all of a sudden?}</b>

07:05.131 --> 07:06.091
<b>Well…</b>

07:06.801 --> 07:11.841
<b>I decided it would be most efficient 
to destroy them all in one blast.</b>

07:11.841 --> 07:13.891
<b>Well, that's true, but…</b>

07:14.641 --> 07:17.181
<b>We could've at least seen 
what they{the bad guys} had in store for us.</b>

07:17.971 --> 07:20.391
<b>That was kind of mean.</b>

07:26.151 --> 07:27.731
<b>Looks like there's a basement.</b>

07:40.501 --> 07:43.041
<b>S-Stop!</b>

07:59.311 --> 08:01.811
<b>Hey, Carnage Kabuto.</b>

08:02.141 --> 08:04.191
<b>Are you well?</b>

08:04.191 --> 08:07.571
<b>It appears you've killed a bunch of my clones again.</b>

08:08.271 --> 08:09.861
<b>Satisfied?</b>

08:09.861 --> 08:10.821
<b>Huh?{honestly, I want to do something like what chihiro did with the way this guy talks, but I don't think I could pull off a dialect/accent/whateverthehellyoucallit like this tastefully}{cf. Some-Stuffs' rendition of Okuyasu Nijimura}</b>

08:11.151 --> 08:15.821
<b>Fool! You think this is enough to satisfy me?{Why would I be satisfied?}</b>

08:16.121 --> 08:19.371
<b>You dared to imprison me deep underground.{I've been kept locked up deep beneath the earth.}{YOU dared to fucckign lock me under the ground}{normally i would agree with the swearing but i reckon here it just makes him seem less ominous}</b>

08:19.741 --> 08:25.671
<b>Me! The strongest warrior in 
the entire House of Evolution!</b>

08:25.671 --> 08:28.841
<b>You are mentally unstable.</b>

08:28.841 --> 08:31.711
<b>We couldn't control you, so we had no choice.</b>

08:32.761 --> 08:34.931
<b>Control?</b>

08:36.011 --> 08:37.971
<b>You moron!</b>

08:37.971 --> 08:42.561
<b>I'm the culmination of all your efforts 
to produce a "new human."{the "New Human" you guys have sought for so long.}</b>

08:42.561 --> 08:47.771
<b>My intelligence and physical strength make me 
incomparable to you obsolete humans!{and your own are incomparable!}{to you obsolete humans}{check cps Hyaku}</b>

08:47.771 --> 08:52.861
<b><i>You</i> should be the ones obeying <i>me</i>.</b>

08:54.451 --> 08:56.991
<b><i>You're wrong. You're a failure.</i></b>

08:56.991 --> 09:00.661
<b><i>It's true your performance is unparalleled{at unheard of levels}, 
but you lack humanity.</i></b>

09:01.451 --> 09:03.161
<b>Go ahead, kill me.</b>

09:03.501 --> 09:05.661
<b>Plenty of clones could take my place.</b>

09:05.661 --> 09:07.331
<b>Oh?</b>

09:07.331 --> 09:08.671
<b>But I have a favor to ask first.</b>

09:09.751 --> 09:12.461
<b>There's a specimen I must have.</b>

09:14.221 --> 09:16.761
<b>He is extremely strong.</b>

09:16.761 --> 09:18.431
<b>Only you can defeat him.</b>

09:19.301 --> 09:21.601
<b>I want you to catch him for me…</b>

09:24.431 --> 09:26.351
<b>…dead or alive.</b>

09:29.151 --> 09:31.111
<b>This basement is huge!</b>

09:31.401 --> 09:32.901
<b>I'm getting kinda fired up!</b>

09:35.821 --> 09:36.111
<b>Huh?</b>

09:37.071 --> 09:38.821
<b>I sense life-forms further ahead{deeper in}…</b>

09:40.201 --> 09:43.451
<b>Master, two of them are approaching.</b>

09:46.501 --> 09:48.251
<b>Oh, here we go!</b>

09:48.961 --> 09:50.791
<b>There are two. Which one is it?</b>

09:50.791 --> 09:52.921
<b>The one on the right…</b>

09:52.921 --> 09:56.631
<b>In that case, you don't need the one on the left!</b>

09:58.511 --> 09:59.391
<b>Genos?</b>

10:01.101 --> 10:02.101
<b>Huh?</b>

10:03.141 --> 10:03.811
<b>Hello?{Hey…}{dunno what's going on here; gonna trust my predecessors}</b>

10:05.851 --> 10:08.691
<b>I am Carnage Kabuto!</b>

10:08.691 --> 10:11.611
<b>We've got a combat experimentation room.</b>

10:12.231 --> 10:15.111
<b>Let's let loose{take this} in there.</b>

10:15.481 --> 10:18.361
<b>You turned Genos into a piece of modern art.</b>

10:19.951 --> 10:21.371
<b>Bring it on!{Fight's on!}</b>

10:30.251 --> 10:31.751
<b>Pretty big, eh?</b>

10:32.041 --> 10:35.001
<b>It's the biggest room in the facility.</b>

10:35.001 --> 10:41.011
<b>This is where they make us fight to test our combat abilities.</b>

10:41.591 --> 10:45.261
<b>Well then, let the slaughter begin{let's start the killing}.</b>

10:48.431 --> 10:49.101
<b>Oh?</b>

10:49.771 --> 10:52.101
<b>Still alive, huh?</b>

11:13.581 --> 11:16.461
<b>You fool!</b>

11:16.801 --> 11:18.211
<b>Machine Gun Blows!</b>

11:31.891 --> 11:33.231
<b>He got me.</b>

11:33.851 --> 11:35.021
<b>Let me…</b>

11:36.231 --> 11:37.111
<b>…take him…</b>

11:37.781 --> 11:41.071
<b>Your face is all cracked. Don't push yourself.</b>

11:48.701 --> 11:50.621
<b>With his breath? Impossible!</b>

11:55.751 --> 11:57.541
<b>Genos, you okay?</b>

11:57.541 --> 11:59.301
<b>Yes…</b>

12:01.011 --> 12:03.261
<b>No, you're not! Look at your head!</b>

12:10.101 --> 12:13.811
<b>You've gone and gotten my hopes up.</b>

12:34.051 --> 12:39.171
<b><i>I have always been critical of humans 
and their inferior abilities.</i></b>

12:39.791 --> 12:44.761
<b><i>The entire species, myself excluded, 
is nothing more than{can be viewed only as} dumb animals.</i></b>

12:45.261 --> 12:47.801
<b><i>That realization was agonizing.</i></b>

12:48.261 --> 12:51.561
<b><i>If memory serves, I was 15 when it occurred to me.</i></b>

12:52.431 --> 12:55.101
<b><i>A plan to evolve the human species{animal}</i></b>

12:55.101 --> 12:58.941
<b><i>and create a world where I could live contentedly.</i></b>

12:58.941 --> 13:03.231
<b><i>A utopia of my own creation, just for me.</i></b>

13:03.231 --> 13:09.831
<b><i>A world made up of only us, a new breed of human that will transcend humanity!</i></b>

13:18.161 --> 13:19.591
<b><i>I must see it through.</i></b>

13:21.131 --> 13:26.971
<b><i>Compared to my anguish back then, 
the physical pain I feel now is nothing.</i></b>

13:27.711 --> 13:30.721
<b>What's the holdup? Let's go!</b>

13:30.721 --> 13:32.431
<b>Show me everything you've got.</b>

13:33.851 --> 13:36.061
<b><i>Carnage Kabuto, a demon incarnate.</i></b>

13:36.061 --> 13:38.851
<b><i>The strongest and most brutal creation 
of the House of Evolution.</i></b>

13:39.691 --> 13:42.981
<b><i>Let's see how you, at your 
archaic stage of human development,</i></b>

13:42.981 --> 13:46.361
<b><i>fare against{ a monster that is} the pinnacle of artificial evolution.{cps}</i></b>

13:46.861 --> 13:51.121
<b><i>Will you be the spark for a new era of evolution?</i></b>

13:52.201 --> 13:54.241
<b><i>I can't wait to find out!</i></b>

13:57.371 --> 14:00.711
<b>Oh, I get{see} it. I get{see} it!</b>

14:00.711 --> 14:02.621
<b>You're supposed to be strong.</b>

14:02.621 --> 14:04.131
<b>Don't disappoint me now.</b>

14:04.751 --> 14:07.501
<b>You're this place's ultimate weapon, right?</b>

14:07.501 --> 14:09.891
<b>You're clearly not the same as the guys from this morning.</b>

14:10.421 --> 14:13.011
<b>Look at you, just oozing with confidence.</b>

14:18.141 --> 14:19.141
<b><i>Such speed!</i></b>

14:29.401 --> 14:30.491
<b>What are you doing?</b>

14:31.951 --> 14:32.491
<b>Hey.</b>

14:36.031 --> 14:37.491
<b>He backed off?</b>

14:37.491 --> 14:39.291
<b>Carnage Kabuto backed off?!</b>

14:40.701 --> 14:43.671
<b><i>If I'd attacked him just now, 
he would've killed me!</i></b>

14:44.541 --> 14:46.801
<b><i>Who the hell is this guy?</i></b>

14:47.251 --> 14:49.381
<b><i>He's leaving himself wide open,</i></b>

14:49.381 --> 14:54.011
<b><i>yet all my instincts are screaming out danger{, sending out danger signals}!</i></b>

14:54.011 --> 14:54.811
<b>Huh?</b>

14:54.811 --> 14:57.061
<b>You bastard!</b>

14:57.391 --> 15:03.061
<b>How the hell did you get so{that} strong?!</b>

15:10.981 --> 15:12.741
<b>So you wanna know too?</b>

15:14.281 --> 15:15.281
<b>Okay, fine.</b>

15:17.821 --> 15:19.581
<b>Genos, you listen carefully too.</b>

15:20.951 --> 15:22.831
<b><i>He's going to tell us right now?!</i></b>

15:23.371 --> 15:26.791
<b><i>The secret to his power?</i></b>

15:26.791 --> 15:28.211
<b>I'd like to know, too.</b>

15:29.961 --> 15:30.511
<b>Huh?</b>

15:31.001 --> 15:31.961
<b>Who are you?</b>

15:31.961 --> 15:33.221
<b>I am Genus.</b>

15:36.261 --> 15:39.511
<b>Well, fine. Listen up.</b>

15:39.891 --> 15:40.931
<b><i>It's too risky!</i></b>

15:41.561 --> 15:43.931
<b><i>Is it really okay for these guys to hear it?{He can't let these guys know his secret!}</i></b>

15:44.891 --> 15:46.401
<b>First of all,</b>

15:46.811 --> 15:50.521
<b>you need to make sure to stick 
to this intense training regimen.{possibly split this Hyaku, seems a bit long}</b>

15:51.821 --> 15:53.651
<b><i>Training?</i></b>

15:53.651 --> 15:56.281
<b><i>Not augmentation surgery or genetic enhancement?</i></b>

15:56.281 --> 15:58.161
<b><i>Training?!</i></b>

15:58.161 --> 16:00.661
<b><i>What kind of…{ training}?</i></b>

16:02.621 --> 16:04.291
<b>Listen up, Genos.</b>

16:05.461 --> 16:06.871
<b>You just have to keep at it.</b>

16:08.631 --> 16:10.501
<b>No matter how hard it gets.</b>

16:11.751 --> 16:14.511
<b>It took me three years to get this strong.</b>

16:16.341 --> 16:18.641
<b>One hundred push-ups!</b>

16:18.641 --> 16:20.931
<b>One hundred sit-ups!</b>

16:20.931 --> 16:22.101
<b>One hundred squats!</b>

16:23.441 --> 16:25.691
<b>Then a ten-kilometer run!</b>

16:26.061 --> 16:28.191
<b>Every single day!</b>

16:36.821 --> 16:39.581
<b>And of course, make sure you eat three meals a day.</b>

16:40.531 --> 16:42.701
<b>For breakfast, just a banana's fine.{Just a banana in the morning is fine.}</b>

16:42.701 --> 16:45.751
<b>But the most important thing is to 
never use the A/C in summer</b>

16:43.291 --> 16:49.041
Save

16:43.291 --> 16:49.041
money

16:45.751 --> 16:49.041
<b>or the heater in winter, so that you can strengthen the mind.</b>

16:53.001 --> 16:55.431
<b>In the beginning, you'll wish you were dead.</b>

16:56.211 --> 16:59.931
<b>You might start thinking, 
"What's the harm in taking a day off?"</b>

17:01.221 --> 17:05.101
<b>But for me, in order to be a strong hero,</b>

17:05.101 --> 17:09.691
<b>no matter how tough it was, 
even if I was spitting blood, I <i>never</i> stopped.{this is a ridiculously cut-and-dry instance of verbal emphasis, and nobody else italicized it. am I taking crazy pills or something?}</b>

17:10.481 --> 17:13.691
<b>I kept doing squats even when my legs felt so heavy they refused to move.</b>

17:14.401 --> 17:17.281
<b>Even when my arms started 
making weird clicking noises,</b>

17:17.281 --> 17:19.151
<b>I kept doing push-ups.</b>

17:20.911 --> 17:24.041
<b>A year and a half later, 
I started to notice a difference.</b>

17:24.331 --> 17:25.951
<b>I was bald…</b>

17:26.541 --> 17:28.581
<b>And I had become stronger!</b>

17:30.081 --> 17:34.801
<b>In other words, you gotta train like hell 
until your hair falls out.</b>

17:35.091 --> 17:38.091
<b>That's the only way to become strong.</b>

17:40.051 --> 17:44.221
<b>Anyone just screwing with evolution 
and trying to create a "new human race"</b>

17:44.221 --> 17:46.771
<b>will never make it this far.</b>

17:47.221 --> 17:50.481
<b>The ability to grow and adapt 
is humanity's greatest strength!{Humans are strong because 
we have the ability to change ourselves.}</b>

17:51.231 --> 17:53.781
<b><i>Wh-What?</i></b>

17:53.781 --> 17:55.781
<b><i>Is this guy… for real?</i></b>

17:56.651 --> 17:57.861
<b><i>Master…</i></b>

17:59.241 --> 18:00.821
<b><i>You are so…</i></b>

18:02.161 --> 18:03.821
<b>full of crap!{I'm of two minds about the level of vulgarity used here. toning it down because I toned it down elsewhere}{revisit perhaps}{revisit note: this is genos, who's always super formal and serious, so "crap" is already a deviation from his usual manner of speech; sticking with "crap"}{wait this goes from thoughts to not thoughts, this doesn't quite translate, does it}</b>

18:03.821 --> 18:04.411
<b>Huh?</b>

18:04.991 --> 18:07.991
<b>That's just ordinary strength training!</b>

18:09.041 --> 18:10.961
<b>And it's not even that intense!</b>

18:11.541 --> 18:13.381
<b>Anyone could do it!{It's just a normal level!}</b>

18:13.381 --> 18:13.671
<b>I…</b>

18:14.581 --> 18:17.051
<b>I have to get stronger!</b>

18:17.051 --> 18:21.641
<b>I didn't ask to study under you so I could listen to your jokes!</b>

18:23.641 --> 18:26.051
<b>Master Saitama, your power…</b>

18:26.051 --> 18:29.391
<b>is clearly beyond what you can achieve 
by just training your body!</b>

18:29.391 --> 18:32.151
<b><i>That's right, I want to know your—</i></b>

18:32.561 --> 18:34.981
<b>We want to know your true secret!</b>

18:37.071 --> 18:38.111
<b>Genos…</b>

18:39.691 --> 18:42.821
<b>You may not believe me, 
but that's really all I did.</b>

18:43.861 --> 18:45.621
<b>Oh yeah?</b>

18:49.411 --> 18:50.831
<b>No! Carnage Kabuto!</b>

18:51.581 --> 18:56.341
<b>If you don't wanna tell us your secret, so be it.</b>

18:57.711 --> 19:00.761
<b>Stop! You'll go on another rampage!</b>

19:01.171 --> 19:04.761
<b>I bet you aren't stronger than me anyway!</b>

19:08.481 --> 19:13.401
<b>But, since you pissed me off,</b>

19:13.811 --> 19:16.151
<b>I'm gonna annihilate you.</b>

